# Allowlist, not a blocklist: everything is excluded first, then only the
# files the installed extension actually needs are added back. A new
# top-level folder is therefore never shipped by accident — add it here
# explicitly if it belongs in the package.
#
# Negations always win in vsce, so list files, not directories: `!out/**`
# would drag the sourcemaps back in too.
**

!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
!icon.png
!demo.gif
!out/extension.js
!out/client.js
!out/client.css
!vendor/plantuml.jar
